Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 09:15:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?bsp/abstract-machine:=20=E6=8A=91=E5=88=B6=20el?=
 =?UTF-8?q?mfat=20stringop-overflow=20=E5=91=8A=E8=AD=A6?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

GCC 11 的 -Wstringop-overflow（-Wall 隐含）误报 elmfat gen_numname 写越界，
而 AM 构建全局带 -Werror，导致 ff.c 编译失败、CI make run 中断。
与已有的 -Wno-nonnull-compare 同理，加 -Wno-stringop-overflow 压制。

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 bsp/abstract-machine/Makefile | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/bsp/abstract-machine/Makefile b/bsp/abstract-machine/Makefile
index 51ae6b0eb..ef29bb31d 100644
--- a/bsp/abstract-machine/Makefile
+++ b/bsp/abstract-machine/Makefile
@@ -8,6 +8,7 @@ NAME = rtthread
 SRCS = $(shell find src -name "*.c")
 CFLAGS += -DHAVE_CCONFIG_H -D__RTTHREAD__
 CFLAGS += -Wno-nonnull-compare
+CFLAGS += -Wno-stringop-overflow
 
 ifneq ($(findstring ysyxsoc,$(ARCH)),)
   LDFLAGS +=
-- 
